{"id":72886,"date":"2026-11-06T08:19:56","date_gmt":"2026-11-06T08:19:56","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=72886"},"modified":"2026-11-06T09:21:36","modified_gmt":"2026-11-06T08:21:36","slug":"trail-run-aqui-ha-os","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/trail-run-aqui-ha-os\/","title":{"rendered":"Trail Run Aqui H\u00c1-OS 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Trail Run Aqui H\u00c1-OS 2027<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Trail Run Aqui H\u00c1-OS 2027<\/strong> (6\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o) realiza-se no dia <strong>2 de maio de 2027<\/strong> (domingo), com epicentro, secretariado (Ecomuseu Ponto Q), partida e meta na <strong>Praia de Quiaios<\/strong>, no concelho da <strong>Figueira da Foz<\/strong>, distrito de <strong>Coimbra<\/strong>. Certificada pela Federa\u00e7\u00e3o Portuguesa de Atletismo (FPA), a prova integra os circuitos oficiais da FPA e da Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Distrital de Atletismo de Coimbra (ADAC).<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Os percursos de <strong>31 km<\/strong> (Trail Longo, 1425 m D+, partida \u00e0s 09:00), <strong>17 km<\/strong> (Trail Sprint, 850 m D+, partida \u00e0s 09:30), <strong>10 km<\/strong> (Mini Trail, 600 m D+, partida \u00e0s 09:45) e a <strong>Caminhada de 10 km<\/strong> (600 m D+, partida \u00e0s 09:45) serpenteiam pelas encostas norte e oeste da emblem\u00e1tica <strong>Serra da Boa Viagem<\/strong>, combinando single-tracks t\u00e9cnicos, estrad\u00f5es florestais e miradouros naturais sobre o oceano Atl\u00e2ntico e as dunas de Quiaios.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o t\u00e9cnica deste evento de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/trail\/\">trail running<\/a> est\u00e1 a cargo da associa\u00e7\u00e3o <strong>Talentos Objetivos \u2013 Clube de Enduro e Recreio<\/strong>, com o apoio da Junta de Freguesia de Quiaios e da C\u00e2mara Municipal da Figueira da Foz. Descobre mais provas no guia de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/corridas-10km\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Corridas de 10 km<\/a> e calcula o teu ritmo na <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/calculadora\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Calculadora de Pace<\/a>.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">2 de Maio de 2027<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho & Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Praia de Quiaios (Ecomuseu Ponto Q), Figueira da Foz, Coimbra<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Dist\u00e2ncias<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">31 km (Trail Longo), 17 km (Trail Sprint), 10 km (Mini Trail) e 10 km (Caminhada)<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr