n: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">1\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 15.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 31\/03\/2027)<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">2\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 20.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (01\/04 a 26\/04\/2027)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 200px;\"><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Trail<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Mini Trail (10 km)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 2 de Maio de 2027 \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:45 \u2022 \u26f0\ufe0f 600m D+<\/span><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">1\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 10.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 31\/03\/2027)<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">2\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 15.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (01\/04 a 26\/04\/2027)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 200px;\"><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Caminhada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Caminhada (10 km)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 2 de Maio de 2027 \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:45 \u2022 \u26f0\ufe0f 600m D+<\/span><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">1\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 10.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 31\/03\/2027)<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">2\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 15.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (01\/04 a 26\/04\/2027)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/ul><\/div><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza o Trail Run Aqui H\u00c1-OS 2027?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A 6\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o do Trail Run Aqui H\u00c1-OS realiza-se no domingo, 2 de maio de 2027, na Praia de Quiaios (Figueira da Foz, Coimbra). O secretariado funciona no Ecomuseu Ponto Q no s\u00e1bado (1 de maio, das 14:00 \u00e0s 20:00) e no domingo a partir das 07:00.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias, desn\u00edveis e hor\u00e1rios de partida?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O programa integra quatro provas na Serra da Boa Viagem: Trail Longo de 31 km (1425 m D+, partida \u00e0s 09:00), Trail Sprint de 17 km (850 m D+, partida \u00e0s 09:30), Mini Trail de 10 km (600 m D+, partida \u00e0s 09:45) e Caminhada de 10 km (partida \u00e0s 09:45). Planeia os teus ritmos na nossa <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/calculadora\/\">calculadora de pace<\/a>.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e prazos de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o para 2027?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Na 1\u00aa fase (at\u00e9 31 de mar\u00e7o de 2027), os valores s\u00e3o de 25 \u20ac no Trail Longo (23,50 \u20ac para filiados ADAC), 15 \u20ac no Trail Sprint e 10 \u20ac no Mini Trail e Caminhada. Na 2\u00aa fase (de 1 a 26 de abril de 2027), passam para 30 \u20ac, 20 \u20ac e 15 \u20ac, respetivamente, com oferta da 6\u00aa inscri\u00e7\u00e3o a cada equipa de 5 atletas pagos.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o tempo limite e o material obrigat\u00f3rio exigido?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As barreiras hor\u00e1rias finais s\u00e3o de 6 horas nos 31 km (com corte \u00e0s 4 horas ao km 20), 4 horas nos 17 km e 3 horas nos 10 km. Nas corridas competitivas \u00e9 obrigat\u00f3rio transportar dorsal vis\u00edvel, manta t\u00e9rmica, apito, telem\u00f3vel operacional e reservat\u00f3rio de \u00e1gua com m\u00ednimo de 0,5 L.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quem organiza a prova e o que est\u00e1 inclu\u00eddo na inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento \u00e9 organizado pela associa\u00e7\u00e3o Talentos Objetivos \u2013 Clube de Enduro e Recreio, enriquecendo o calend\u00e1rio de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/corridas-coimbra\/\">corridas em Coimbra<\/a>. A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o inclui dorsal personalizado com chip, t-shirt t\u00e9cnica oficial, abastecimentos, seguro desportivo e lanche conv\u00edvio final com sopa e bifana.<\/div><\/details><\/div><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Trail Run Aqui H\u00c1-OS 2027\", \"startDate\": \"2027-05-02\", \"endDate\": \"2027-05-02\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Praia de Quiaios (Ecomuseu Ponto Q), Figueira da Foz\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Figueira da Foz\", \"addressRegion\": \"Coimbra\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"description\": \"O 6\u00ba Trail Run Aqui H\u00c1-OS 2027 realiza-se a 2 de maio na Praia de Quiaios, Figueira da Foz. Percursos de 31 km, 17 km e 10 km na Serra da Boa Viagem. Inscreve!\", \"image\": [\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/trail-run-aqui-ha-os-2026.webp\"], \"offers\": [{\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Trail Longo (31 km)\", \"price\": \"25.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/www.runmanager.net\/Eventos\/6-trail-run-aqui-ha-os\/984\", \"validFrom\": \"2027-01-01\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Trail Sprint (17 km)\", \"price\": \"15.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/www.runmanager.net\/Eventos\/6-trail-run-aqui-ha-os\/984\", \"validFrom\": \"2027-01-01\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Mini Trail (10 km)\", \"price\": \"10.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/www.runmanager.net\/Eventos\/6-trail-run-aqui-ha-os\/984\", \"validFrom\": \"2027-01-01\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Caminhada (10 km)\", \"price\": \"10.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"http